sequenceDiagram
    actor App as Vartojanti programa
    participant TF as PoseDetector (TF.js)
    participant CFA as computeFrameAngles
    participant BJS as buildJointSummaries
    participant BR as buildRecommendations

    loop Kiekvienas kadras (kas 0.2 sek.)
        App->>TF: estimatePoses(videoFrame)
        TF-->>App: keypoints[]
        App->>CFA: computeFrameAngles(keypoints)
        CFA-->>App: FrameAngles
    end

    App->>BJS: buildJointSummaries(frames[], "road")
    BJS-->>App: JointSummary[]

    App->>BR: buildRecommendations(summaries)
    BR-->>App: Recommendation[]
